  body: "# Funeral-payment conditions, allowable expenses and deductions\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe captured
    guide places satisfaction of the funeral-payment conditions before consideration of amount, and allowable funeral
    expenses before deductions. Necessary and reasonable specified expenses have an evidence requirement.\n\n##
    Scope and exceptions\n\nThe rule that capital has no effect on SSMG or funeral-payment claims from 8 October
    2001 does not remove deductions from allowable funeral expenses. Necessary/reasonable-cost evidence is expressly
    distinguished from other funeral expenses. No amount or present monetary cap is calculated.\n\n## Inspected
    passages\n\n- [DMG 39003, PDF page 2](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=2).\n\
    - [DMG 39251, PDF page 32](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=32).\n\
    - [DMG 39252, PDF page 32](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=32).\n\
    - [DMG 39253, PDF page 32](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=32).\n\
    - [DMG 39261, PDF page 33](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=33).\n\
    - [DMG 39262, PDF page 33](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68da370d360fa159c37c47/dmg-v-7-ch-39.pdf#page=33).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol7-ch39`:
    PDF `ab13db0cf4d33fd90fb4cd8a90b909af568d39169f617f4b86b1037278d3fa9f`; extracted pages `625425d7933417f8895628354b1be65fc86df4d1f97a55acb13426d6cbe2b8a7`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:28.411887Z`.\n"
