      quote: "39251 The amount of the SFFP is made up of1\n\n\n1. the allowable funeral expenses2 which the claimant,
        their partner, or a person acting on their behalf,\nare responsible for (see DMG 39255) less\n\n\n2. any
        deductions3 (see DMG 39371).\n\n\n                                                     1 SFMFE (Gen) Regs,
        reg 9(1) & (2); 2 reg 9(3); 3 reg 10"
      locator: DMG 39251
